        "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ggpht.com,▶️YouTube稳定", "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gvt1.com,▶️YouTube稳定", "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gvt2.com,▶️YouTube稳定", "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube-nocookie.com,▶️YouTube稳定",
