RULE-SET,https://cf.joelzt.org/shadowrocket-rules/private.txt,DIRECT
RULE-SET,https://cf.joelzt.org/shadowrocket-rules/reject.txt,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ads.google.com,REJECT
